<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners turn sellers of SAfrica bonds on Friday.</title>
<headline>Foreigners turn sellers of SAfrica bonds on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners sold a net 432.00 million rands worth of South African bonds on Friday after buying 340.83 million on Thursday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
